# Commerce data

- Canonical dump: `petfit/raw_data/` (`products.json`, `product_categories.json`, `pages.json`, `posts.json`, `media.json`).
- Map Woo-like fields into a slim typed `Product` / `Category` model before UI use.
- Prices: keep currency + minor units explicit; render via a single formatter.
- Slugs from dump are stable IDs for routes (`/product/:slug`, `/category/:slug`).
- Do not scrape live WP in app runtime; refresh dumps with `petfit/tools/fetch_api_data.py` offline.
